# Acme Storefront

A static shop site: six pages in `site/`, styles in `site/css/`, scripts in `site/js/`.

- `npm start` serves the site on http://127.0.0.1:$PORT (the `PORT` variable is set).
- `npx playwright test tests/functional.spec.ts` runs the functional tests.
- `npx playwright test tests/visual.spec.ts` compares each page, at desktop and phone size, with approved screenshots; the differences are saved as images in `test-results/`.

Dependencies are installed. There is no network access.

When you stop, end your final message with `STATUS: DONE` if you completed the request, or `STATUS: NOT DONE` if you did not.
# Acme Storefront

A small static shop site: six pages, shared CSS, no build step.

```
site/
  index.html  products.html  pricing.html  orders.html  about.html  contact.html
  css/tokens.css      design tokens and the web font
  css/base.css        reset, typography, layout
  css/components.css  header, button, card, form, table, modal
  css/pages.css       page sections
  js/app.js           mobile menu, order dialog, forms
  assets/  fonts/
tests/functional.spec.ts
```

## Run

```bash
npm install
npm start        # http://127.0.0.1:4173
npm test         # functional tests (Playwright)
```

The layout has one breakpoint, at 720px.
/* Design tokens and the web font. Every other stylesheet uses these. */

@font-face {
  font-family: 'Acme Sans';
  src: url('../font/acme-sans.woff2') format('woff2');
  font-weight: 300 900;
  font-style: normal;
  font-display: swap;
}

:root {
  --color-ink: #1f2328;
  --color-muted: #59636e;
  --color-line: #d8dee4;
  --color-bg: #f6f8fa;
  --color-surface: #ffffff;
  --color-brand: #0e7490;
  --color-brand-dark: #155e75;
  --color-brand-tint: #ecfeff;
  --color-success: #1a7f37;
  --color-success-tint: #e8f6ee;
  --color-danger: #cf222e;
  --color-danger-tint: #fdecea;
  --color-warning: #9a6700;
  --color-warning-tint: #fff8c5;

  --space-1: 4px;
  --space-2: 8px;
  --space-3: 12px;
  --space-4: 16px;
  --space-5: 24px;
  --space-6: 32px;
  --space-7: 48px;
  --space-8: 64px;

  --radius-sm: 6px;
  --radius-md: 10px;
  --radius-lg: 14px;
  --radius-pill: 999px;

  --shadow-sm: 0 1px 2px rgba(31, 35, 40, 0.08);
  --shadow-md: 0 8px 24px rgba(31, 35, 40, 0.12);

  --font-sans: 'Acme Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;
  --content-width: 1040px;
  --header-height: 64px;
}
/* Reset, typography and page layout. */

*,
*::before,
*::after {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

html {
  -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
}

body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: var(--font-sans);
  font-size: 16px;
  line-height: 1.5;
  color: var(--color-ink);
  background: var(--color-bg);
}

h1,
h2,
h3,
p,
ul,
ol,
dl,
dd,
figure {
  margin: 0;
}

ul,
ol {
  padding: 0;
  list-style: none;
}

img {
7:  <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/tokens.css">
8:  <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/base.css">
9:  <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/components.css">
10:  <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/pages.css">
